OL,3,GNEWSAPolice object to alcohol and music
OL,4,Alicence for swingers club
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are objecting to a premises
OL,7,Flicence application from a swingers
OL,8,Fclub in Blackpool after it declined to
OL,9,Fagree to proposed door security
OL,10,Fconditions.
OL,12,FClub Play has applied for its first
OL,13,Flong-term premises licence, seeking
OL,14,Fpermission to carry out licensable
OL,15,Factivities such as live music, recorded
OL,16,Fmusic and the sale of alcohol,
OL,17,Fincluding until 03:00 at weekends.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
