OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice object to alcohol and music
OL,4,Alicence for swingers club
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire Constabulary is objecting on
OL,7,Fthe basis it wants door security
OL,8,Fconditions imposed, but the club's
OL,9,Flicensing agent estimates one door
OL,10,Fsupervisor working at weekends would
OL,11,Fcost about #10,400 a year.
OL,13,FThe application is due to be considered
OL,14,Fby Blackpool Council's licensing panel
OL,15,Fon Thursday.
